witchery.rite.wereman.name=Rite of the Wereman
witchery.rite.wereman.desc=After reaching the limits of the werewolf form, your arcane knowledge has given you insights into improving your abilities further. With this rite you reshape your paws to resemble hands, letting you finally hold items as a werewolf. This does not carry into the wolf form, where you simply grip the item in your muzzle. Perform it at werewolf level 10, under the night sky, while shifted into the wolfman form.
witcheryextras.rite.wereman.refused=The spirits reject you. Only a werewolf of the tenth night, untouched by vampiric blood, may attempt this rite.
witcheryextras.rite.wereman.already=You have already walked this path. Your body remembers.
witcheryextras.rite.wereman.notready=Your form is not yet perfected. Reach the tenth night of the wolf before attempting this rite.
witcheryextras.rite.wereman.shift=Shift into your wolfman form within the circle to begin the transformation.
witcheryextras.rite.wereman.stage2=The spirits circle you... hold the wolfman form and let the change take hold.
witcheryextras.rite.wereman.completed=Your hands twist into claws that still remember their shape. You have mastered the greater form - the werewolf now wields what a man would.
witchery.rite.formmastery.name=Rite of Form Mastery
witchery.rite.formmastery.desc=Further experimentation into shape control has revealed how to reshape your body while still keeping your blessings. With this rite the armor of civilization finally fits your werewolf frame, and you may sleep in a bed once more. The wolf form remains a beast - it still cannot wear armor or rest. Perform it at werewolf level 11, under the night sky, while shifted into the wolfman form.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.refused=The spirits reject you. Only a pure-blooded werewolf who has mastered the greater form may attempt this rite.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.already=Your body is already perfected. Another mastery there is not to be found.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.notready=Your control is not yet deep enough. Master the greater form before attempting this rite.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.shift=Shift into your wolfman form within the circle to begin the reshaping.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.stage2=The spirits weave through your frame... hold the wolfman form and let the body settle.
witcheryextras.rite.formmastery.completed=Your body yields and reshapes itself. You are Wereman - the armor of civilization now fits the beast, and you may rest as one, while its powers remain yours.
